# Sala 1 de la Liga (Iver, Ice, C9, contract 56), 11 x 12, interior, ONE room of the League four run (contract 50.2): ICE: big pale ice slabs (2 x 2) with a frost dither and one hairline crack per block, PixelLab ice crystals in the corners and snow drifts. column = i, row = j. The hero arrives at (5,10) facing NE; the door BEHIND him (5,11) is a solid NPC that appears when league_run is set;
# the member stands at (5,4) facing SW (+j), the door AHEAD (5,1) is a solid NPC hidden when the member's beaten flag (league_e1) is set, the doorway (5,0) is the warp (`oneway`). No exit warp, no way back (a loss is the blackout to the lobby).
@map liga_hielo
@size 11 12
@interior yes
@bg 0
@fill iceslab_00
@spawn in 5 10 NE
@legend
  K  tile=none object=wall_corner
  w  tile=none object=wall_j
  |  tile=none object=wall_i
  0  tile=iceslab_10 
  1  tile=iceslab_11 
  2  tile=iceslab_01 
  3  tile=iceslab_11 npc=keydoor id=door_a face=S solid=yes gate=yes text=gl.c9.door.locked hide_flag=league_e1
  4  tile=iceslab_10 
  5  tile=iceslab_00 object=icecr
  6  tile=iceslab_00 
  7  tile=iceslab_10 npc=iver id=member face=SW trainer=iver text=lg.iver.pre after=lg.iver.after beaten_flag=league_e1 range=4
  8  tile=iceslab_10 object=snowdrift
  9  tile=iceslab_10 object=icecr
  a  tile=iceslab_00 object=snowdrift
  b  tile=iceslab_11 npc=keydoor id=door_x face=S solid=yes gate=yes text=gl.c9.door.shut show_flag=league_run
@grid
  Kwwww0wwwww
  |1212321212
  |4546464546
  |1212121212
  |4646764646
  |1212121212
  |4686468646
  |1212121212
  |9646464696
  |1212121212
  |4a46464a46
  |1212b21212
@warp 0 -> liga_lucha spawn=in oneway
# Entering room 1 shuts the door behind the hero and starts the run (flag league_run; a blackout clears it). Idempotent: a Continuar inside does not shut it twice.
@script league_in on_enter
    jf league_run in
    sfx door
    setf league_run
    say gl.c9.door.shut
  in:
@end
